expect Pass-and-play classics
tap Reversi
expect Set the table
tap How to play
expect Bracketed discs flip
wait 250
clean
shot parlor-help
tap Set up game
tap Start game
expect Tap a hollow destination
clean
shot reversi
scenario storage-full
tap-id cell-19
expect Progress is not saved
clean
